id: diluted-majin
name: Diluted Majin
# A Racial Factor: what it asks for, shown beside its Factor Trait and never enforced (the user's).
requirement: Majin
maximumFactor: 1
prerequisites: N/A
description: >
  Instead of being purely formed of the chewing gum-like goop Majins seem to be infinitely constructed from, you possess a somewhat altered structure reminiscent of the more 'classical' Majins.
